<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="naver-site-verification" content="1dcd35b391c111675db547f385c593265e469209" />
<meta name="google-site-verification" content="j55S4WFJbp0jq6qT0KyG3rOdQeSJtZPlzPBR2Syx8lc" />
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "Organization", "name": "코지 꽃수첩", "url": "https://dorazy.art/", "logo": "https://dorazy.art/assets/brand/doraji-icon.png", "sameAs": ["https://www.instagram.com/dorazy.art/"]}</script>
<title>코지 꽃수첩 — 더코지 플로리스트 꽃 도감</title>
<meta name="description" content="더코지 플로리스트 꽃 371종의 등급·길드전 점수·획득 방법을 모아보는 팬메이드 꽃 도감. 컨셉별·종류별 취향 탐색까지.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/favicon.ico">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
<style>@font-face {
  font-family: 'GangwonEduAll';
  src: url('/assets/fonts/GangwonEduAll-sub.woff2?v=ec9c0226') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 700; font-display: swap;
}
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Pretendard';
  src: url('/assets/fonts/Pretendard-sub.woff2?v=d03c6c75') format('woff2-variations');
  font-weight: 45 920; font-display: swap;
}
:root {
  --bg-main: #FFF7E9; --bg-card: #FFFDF4; --bg-soft: #FFF1D9;
  --tx-1: #5E4732; --tx-2: #86705C; --tx-3: #A8927B;
  --purple: #7B57C9; --purple-deep: #5F3DB0; --purple-pale: #EFE7FD; --purple-line: #8D6BDB;
  --green: #6FB84F; --yellow: #FFD24D;
  --line-warm: #EBD9BC; --line-soft: #F2E5CC;
  --gold-a: #E7C98A; --gold-b: #F8EDC6; --gold-c: #D9B96E;
  --lav-a: #E3D3F6; --lav-b: #CBB3EC;
  --ok: #5BAE4E; --soon: #F2A93B; --gone: #B8B1A4;
}
* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  font-family: 'Pretendard', -apple-system, 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
  background: var(--bg-main); color: var(--tx-1);
  max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto;
}
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }

/* 진열칸 */
.frame { padding: 3px; border-radius: 16px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold-a), var(--gold-b) 45%, var(--gold-c)); }
.frame-in { width: 100%; height: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 13px;
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 24% 22%, rgba(255,255,255,.75) 1.6px, transparent 2.6px),
    radial-gradient(circle at 78% 68%, rgba(255,255,255,.6) 1.3px, transparent 2.2px),
    linear-gradient(160deg, var(--lav-a), var(--lav-b));
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; overflow: hidden; }
.frame-in img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 11px; display: block; }
.frame-in .ph { font-size: 34px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }

/* 헤더 */
header { padding: 16px 16px 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
.logo-block { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
.logo-block img { height: 42px; }
.site-name { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.05; }
.site-name .p { color: var(--purple); }
.insta-pill { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx-1);
  font-weight: 500; background: #FFFEF9; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 12px; }
.ig { width: 15px; height: 15px; display: block; }
.divider { position: relative; text-align: center; margin: 2px 16px 0; height: 22px; }
.divider::before, .divider::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 10px; height: 2px;
  width: calc(50% - 44px);
  background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--line-warm) 1px, transparent 1.4px);
  background-size: 7px 2px; background-repeat: repeat-x; }
.divider::before { left: 0; } .divider::after { right: 0; }
.divider img { height: 20px; }

/* 이번 주 새 꽃 / 가로 스트립 */
.weekly { padding: 12px 0 4px 16px; }
.weekly-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.weekly-head img { height: 21px; }
.weekly-head h2 { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
.badge-cnt { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; background: var(--purple);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 9px; }
.weekly-row { display: flex; gap: 9px; overflow-x: auto; padding-right: 16px; scrollbar-width: none; }
.weekly-row::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.slot { flex: 0 0 88px; }
.slot .frame { width: 88px; height: 88px; }
.slot-name { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--tx-2); margin-top: 5px;
  white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; text-align: center; }

/* 검색 */
.controls { padding: 14px 16px 0; }
.search-box { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 11px 16px; background: #FFFEF9; }
.search-box:focus-within { border-color: var(--purple); }
.search-input { flex: 1; border: 0; outline: 0; background: transparent;
  font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; color: var(--tx-1); min-width: 0; }
.search-input::placeholder { color: var(--tx-3); }
.search-box > img { height: 18px; }
.sicon { width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 2px solid var(--tx-3); border-radius: 50%;
  position: relative; flex: 0 0 14px; }
.sicon::after { content: ''; position: absolute; width: 6px; height: 2px;
  background: var(--tx-3); transform: rotate(45deg); left: 11px; top: 13px; }

/* 필터 칩 */
.chips, .chip-sub-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 12px 16px 2px;
  scrollbar-width: none; }
.chip-sub-row { padding-top: 8px; }
.chip-sub-row[hidden], .empty[hidden] { display: none; }
.chips::-webkit-scrollbar, .chip-sub-row::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.chip { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 999px;
  padding: 8px 13px; white-space: nowrap; border: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  background: #FFFDF4; color: var(--tx-2); font-weight: 500; }
.chip.on { background: var(--purple-pale); border: 1.5px solid var(--purple);
  color: var(--purple-deep); font-weight: 700; padding: 7.5px 13px; }
.chip .cbox { width: 15px; height: 15px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm);
  color: transparent; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.chip.on .cbox { background: var(--purple); border-color: var(--purple); color: #fff; }
.chip.sub { font-size: 12.5px; padding: 6px 11px; }
.chip.sub.on { padding: 5.5px 11px; }

.chip.reset { color: #B5453B; border-color: #EBCDC2; background: #FFF9F5; font-weight: 600; }
.chip.reset[hidden] { display: none; }

/* 결과줄 */
.result-line { padding: 12px 16px 2px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--tx-1);
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
.result-line .leaf-in { height: 13px; vertical-align: -2px; margin-left: 3px; }
.sort select { font-family: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--tx-2);
  border: 0; background: transparent; outline: 0; }

/* 카드 그리드 */
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; padding: 10px 16px 22px; }
@media (min-width: 480px) { .grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
.fcard { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 8px 8px 10px; min-width: 0; display: block;
  transition: transform .12s, border-color .12s; }
.fcard:active, .fcard:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--purple-line); }
.fcard-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.grade { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.03em; background: var(--purple-pale);
  color: var(--purple-deep); border-radius: 999px; padding: 2.5px 8px; }
/* 등급 컬러 (2026-08-08 교장님 팔레트) */
.grade.g-ur  { background: #FCCAD4; color: #B04A66; }
.grade.g-ssr { background: #FCDE98; color: #8A650F; }
.grade.g-sr  { background: #E2D3F4; color: #6C4BA8; }
.grade.g-r   { background: #C2E0EF; color: #3A6E8F; }
.grade.g-n   { background: #D1EAA1; color: #5C7D25; }
.grade.g-tbd { background: #ECECEC; color: #8A8A8A; font-weight: 600; }
.sdot { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; }
.sdot.ok { background: var(--ok); } .sdot.soon { background: var(--soon); } .sdot.gone { background: var(--gone); }
.fcard .frame { width: 100%; }
/* 카드 글씨 한 단계 축소 + 점수 잘림 방지 (2026-08-09 교장님) */
.fname { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--tx-1); margin-top: 7px;
  text-align: center; line-height: 1.32; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
  -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; min-height: calc(13px * 1.32 * 2); }
.fsub { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--tx-3); margin-top: 3px; text-align: center;
  white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.fsub .pts { font-weight: 650; color: var(--tx-2); }
.empty { text-align: center; padding: 40px 16px 50px; color: var(--tx-2); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; }
.empty img { height: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px; opacity: .8; }

/* 아씨의 진열장 — 큐레이션 선반 (2026-08-09) */
/* 「어떤 꽃을 모아볼까요?」 발견 컬렉션 (2026-08-09 교장님 컨펌 v9) */
.collections { padding: 16px 0 0 16px; }
.shelf-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; margin-bottom: 3px; }
.shelf-icon { font-size: 17px; }
.shelf-head h2 { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700; }
.col-sub { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx-2); }
.col-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 12px 16px 4px 0;
  scrollbar-width: none; }
.col-row::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
.tcard { flex: 0 0 138px; background: #FFFEF9; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm);
  border-radius: 16px; padding: 10px 10px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center; gap: 6px; cursor: pointer; transition: transform .15s;
  font-family: inherit; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(94,71,50,.08); }
.tcard.on { border-color: #B9A2DE; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(122,90,182,.22);
  transform: translateY(-3px); background: #FBF7FF; }
.tcard-img { width: 112px; height: 112px; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
  background: #F6EFE3; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.tcard-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.tcard-img .ph, .tcard-img.gh { font-size: 30px; color: var(--tx-3); opacity: .55; }
.tcard-name { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tx-1); white-space: nowrap; }
.tcard-count { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx-3); }
.tcard-ghost { border-style: dashed; background: transparent; box-shadow: none; cursor: default; }
.theme-reset { border: 1.2px solid #EBCDC2; background: #FFF9F5; color: #B5453B;
  font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 10px;
  cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
.theme-reset[hidden] { display: none; }
.shelf-tag { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--purple); background: var(--purple-pale);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 8px; }
.shelf-comment { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--tx-2); margin: 0 16px 9px 0; }
.dex-divider { margin: 18px 16px 2px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
.dex-divider h2 { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
.dex-divider .line { flex: 1; height: 1.5px; background: var(--line-soft); }

/* ? 도움말 — 카드 표시 안내 (2026-08-09 교장님) */
.help-btn { width: 21px; height: 21px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm);
  background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--tx-2); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex: none; }
.help-btn.on { background: var(--purple-pale); border-color: var(--purple-line); color: var(--purple-deep); }
.legend { margin: 8px 16px 2px; padding: 12px 14px; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm);
  border-radius: 14px; background: var(--bg-card); font-size: 13px; color: var(--tx-2); }
.legend .lg-title { font-weight: 700; color: var(--tx-1); margin-bottom: 8px; }
.legend .lg-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 6px; }
.legend .lg-row .sdot { flex: none; }
.legend .lg-sub { color: var(--tx-3); font-size: 12px; }
.legend .lg-grade { flex: none; min-width: 21px; height: 18px; padding: 0 4px; border-radius: 6px;
  background: var(--bg-soft); color: var(--tx-1); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.legend .lg-mk { flex: none; width: 21px; height: 21px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); background: var(--bg-card); color: var(--tx-2);
  font-size: 12px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }

/* SponsorCard */
.sponsor-wrap { padding: 4px 16px 14px; }
.sponsor-label { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--tx-2); margin-bottom: 6px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }
.sponsor-label .ad { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--tx-2);
  border: 1px solid var(--line-warm); border-radius: 5px; padding: 1px 5px; }
.sponsor-card { background: #FFFDF8; border: 1.5px solid #E8D8C5; border-radius: 16px; padding: 12px; }
.sponsor-img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 21/9; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 10px;
  background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
.sponsor-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 10px; }
.sponsor-copy { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx-2); margin-top: 3px; line-height: 1.45; }
.sponsor-cta { display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
  color: #fff; background: #7B4DFF; border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 15px; }
/* 광고 자리 표시 (파트너 미정 시 — 광고 모집용) */
.sponsor-card.ph { border-style: dashed; text-align: center; padding: 26px 14px; }
.sponsor-ph-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--tx-2); }
.sponsor-ph-body { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx-3); margin-top: 5px; line-height: 1.5; }

/* Footer / SupportCard */
footer { padding: 4px 16px 8px; }
.footer-card { background: #FFFBEE; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 16px 14px; text-align: center; }
.footer-card .f1 { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--tx-1);
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; }
.footer-card .f1 img.ic { height: 18px; } .footer-card .f1 img.lf { height: 14px; }
.footer-card .f2 { font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx-3); margin-top: 6px; }
.footer-card .f2 a { text-decoration: underline; }
.footer-card .f3 { font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx-3); margin-top: 8px; line-height: 1.6; }
.footer-card .f3 a { text-decoration: underline; }
.support-wrap { padding: 8px 16px 20px; }
.support-card { background: #F8F3FF; border: 1.5px solid #DDD0EF; border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 20px 16px; text-align: center; }
.support-card > img { height: 22px; }
.support-title { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; margin-top: 7px; }
.support-body { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx-2); margin-top: 7px; line-height: 1.6;
  max-width: 220px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
.support-cta { display: inline-block; margin-top: 13px; background: var(--purple); color: #fff;
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px 20px; }
.support-note { font-size: 10px; color: var(--tx-3); margin-top: 11px; }
body > :last-child { padding-bottom: 24px; }

/* 상세 페이지 */
.detail { padding: 8px 16px 4px; text-align: center; }
.detail-no { font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx-3); letter-spacing: 0.06em; }
.detail-frame { max-width: 260px; margin: 8px auto 0; }
.detail-name { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 24px; margin-top: 12px; }
.detail-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }
.pts-big { font-size: 13px; color: var(--tx-2); }
.pts-big b { color: var(--tx-1); }
.stat-badge { font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 999px; padding: 3px 10px; }
.stat-badge.ok { background: #E7F3DE; color: #3E7A2E; }
.stat-badge.soon { background: #FFF1CE; color: #9A6B10; }
.stat-badge.gone { background: #F1EBE2; color: var(--tx-3); }
.stat-badge.none { background: var(--bg-soft); color: var(--tx-2); }
.detail-chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 12px; }
.hist { padding: 18px 0 0; text-align: left; }
.hist-row { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 10px 12px; margin: 0 0 8px; margin-right: 16px; }
.detail .hist .hist-row { margin-right: 0; }
.hist-main { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 13px; }
.hstat { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; border-radius: 999px; padding: 2px 8px; }
.hstat.ok { background: #E7F3DE; color: #3E7A2E; }
.hstat.soon { background: #FFF1CE; color: #9A6B10; }
.hstat.gone { background: #F1EBE2; color: var(--tx-3); }
.hstat.unknown { background: var(--bg-soft); color: var(--tx-2); }
.hist-sub { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx-2); margin-top: 4px; line-height: 1.5; }
.detail .weekly { padding-left: 0; }

/* about */
.about { padding: 24px 24px 8px; text-align: center; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--tx-2); }
.about p { margin-top: 14px; }
.about a { color: var(--purple-deep); text-decoration: underline; }
.about-flower { height: 64px; }
.about-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--tx-3); }

/* ── 3탭 구조 (TABS-IA-SPEC, 2026-08-09) ── */
body { padding-bottom: 74px; }
.tabbar { position: fixed; bottom: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); width: 100%; max-width: 560px;
  display: flex; background: #FFFEF9; border-top: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); z-index: 50;
  padding: 6px 0 calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); }
.tb { flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
  font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--tx-3); }
.tb-ic { font-size: 18px; }
.tb.on { color: var(--purple); }
.tb { font-size: 11px; gap: 2px; }  /* 5탭 (2026-08-17 쿠폰 탭 추가) — 여유 확보 */

/* ── 💡 꿀팁 탭 (2026-08-15) ── */
.tip-cat { background: var(--purple); color: #fff; }
.tip-empty { text-align: center; color: var(--tx-3); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;
  padding: 48px 20px; }
.tip-article { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 18px 20px 8px; }
.tip-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.tip-date { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx-3); }
.tip-title { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.35; color: var(--tx-1); margin: 0 0 10px; }
.tip-summary { font-size: 15px; color: var(--tx-2); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 18px;
  padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); }
.tip-body .tip-p { font-size: 15px; color: var(--tx-1); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0 0 16px; }
.tip-body .tip-h { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--tx-1); margin: 26px 0 10px; }
.tip-body .tip-list { margin: 0 0 16px; padding-left: 22px; }
.tip-body .tip-list li { font-size: 15px; color: var(--tx-1); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 6px; }
.tip-quote { margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 8px 14px; border-left: 3px solid var(--purple);
  color: var(--tx-2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; background: #FBF7FF; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; }
.tip-callout { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; margin: 0 0 16px; padding: 12px 14px;
  background: #FFFBF0; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--tx-1); }
.tip-callout-ic { font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
.tip-fig { margin: 4px 0 18px; }
.tip-img { width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; display: block; }
.tip-cap { margin-top: 6px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--tx-3); text-align: center; }
.tip-hr { border: none; border-top: 1.5px dashed var(--line-warm); margin: 22px 0; }
.tip-code { background: #F5F2EC; border-radius: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; overflow-x: auto;
  font-size: 13px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
.tip-body code { background: #F5F2EC; border-radius: 5px; padding: 1px 5px; font-size: 13px; }
.tip-back { display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--purple); }

/* 카드 ✓/♡ 마킹 */
.fcard-top { gap: 4px; }
.mks { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: 4px; }
.mk { width: 23px; height: 23px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm);
  background: #FFFEF9; color: var(--tx-3); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; padding: 0;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
.mk.on.mk-own { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); color: #fff; }
.mk.on.mk-wish { background: #E56B8C; border-color: #E56B8C; color: #fff; }
.mk-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; margin: 10px 0 2px; }
.mkb { border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); background: #FFFEF9; color: var(--tx-2);
  border-radius: 999px; padding: 9px 16px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; font-family: inherit; }
.mkb.on { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); color: #fff; }
.mkb.wish.on { background: #E56B8C; border-color: #E56B8C; }

/* ☀️ 오늘 탭 */
.today-hero { padding: 12px 16px 2px; }
.th-title { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; }
.th-date { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx-3); font-family: 'Pretendard', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; margin-left: 4px; }
.news-card { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; background: #FFFEF9; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-soft);
  border-radius: 14px; padding: 11px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
a.news-card { display: flex; }
.news-card.new { border-color: var(--purple-line); background: #FBF8FF; }
.nbadge { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; border-radius: 8px; padding: 4px 8px; background: var(--bg-soft); }
.nb-new { background: var(--purple); color: #fff; }
.nb-d1 { background: #F2A93B; color: #fff; }
.news-body { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.4; }
.news-sub { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx-3); margin-top: 2px; }
.today-foot { text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx-3); padding: 18px 16px 8px; }

/* ♡ 내 수첩 */
.my-hero { display: flex; gap: 10px; padding: 14px 16px 4px; }
.my-stat { flex: 1; background: #FFFEF9; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); border-radius: 16px; padding: 14px; text-align: center; }
.ms-num { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--purple); }
.ms-num.wish { color: #B04A66; }
.ms-num span { font-size: 13px; margin-left: 2px; }
.ms-cap { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx-2); margin-top: 3px; }
.my-cols { padding: 14px 16px 4px; }
.col-prog { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #FFFEF9; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-soft);
  border-radius: 14px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.cp-ic { font-size: 18px; }
.cp-mid { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
.cp-name { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 5px; }
.cp-bar { height: 7px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--bg-soft); overflow: hidden; }
.cp-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 99px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--lav-b), var(--purple)); }
.cp-num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--tx-2); white-space: nowrap; }
.my-list { padding: 14px 16px 4px; }
.my-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
.my-grid .slot { min-width: 0; }
.my-grid .frame { width: 100%; height: auto; }
.my-empty { color: var(--tx-3); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; padding: 14px 4px 6px; }
.my-empty[hidden] { display: none; }

/* 오늘 탭 v2: 인스타 꽃소식 + 곧 끝나요 (2026-08-09) */
.th-sub { font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--tx-2); margin: -6px 0 10px; }
.ig-feed { padding: 14px 16px 4px; }
.ig-cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
.ig-card { background: var(--bg-card); border: 1.5px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 8px; display: block; min-width: 0; }
.ig-thumb { position: relative; display: block; border-radius: 11px; overflow: hidden; aspect-ratio: 1;
  background: var(--bg-soft); }
.ig-thumb img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
.ig-new { position: absolute; top: 7px; left: 7px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff;
  background: var(--purple); border-radius: 6px; padding: 2.5px 7px; }
.ig-title { display: block; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 7px; line-height: 1.35;
  display: -webkit-box; -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; overflow: hidden; }
.ig-cta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 7px; margin-top: 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); background: #FFFEF9; border-radius: 999px; padding: 10px;
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--tx-1); }
.ending { padding: 14px 16px 4px; }
.end-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: #FFFEF9;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--line-soft); border-radius: 14px; padding: 11px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.end-dd { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; background: #F2A93B;
  border-radius: 8px; padding: 4px 9px; }
.end-dd.today { background: #B5453B; }
.end-name { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.4; min-width: 0; }

/* 오늘 탭 v3: 카드 3종만 — TodayUpdate/InstagramPost/EndingSoon (2026-08-09 교장님 구조 비평) */
.tu-box { background: #FFFEF9; border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); border-radius: 16px; }
.tu-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 13px; min-width: 0; }
.tu-row + .tu-row { border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
.tu-badge { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; background: var(--purple);
  border-radius: 7px; padding: 3px 8px; }
.tu-ic { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 15px; width: 22px; text-align: center; color: var(--tx-2); }
.tu-main { flex: 1; min-width: 0; font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.4; }
.tu-sub { display: block; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--tx-3); margin-top: 2px;
  white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }
.tu-arrow { flex: 0 0 auto; color: var(--tx-3); font-size: 13px; }
.tsec { padding: 16px 16px 0; }
.sec-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.sec-head h2 { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; }
.seemore { font-size: 12px; color: var(--tx-3); font-weight: 500; }
.igp { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; padding: 10px 12px; min-width: 0; }
.igp + .igp { border-top: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
.igp-th { flex: 0 0 52px; width: 52px; height: 52px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }
.end-dd { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; background: #F2A93B;
  border-radius: 7px; padding: 3px 8px; }
.end-th { flex: 0 0 40px; width: 40px; height: 40px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 9px;
  border: 1px solid var(--line-soft); }

/* 내 수첩 3단 (MY-NOTEBOOK-SPEC, 2026-08-09) */
button.my-stat { font-family: inherit; color: inherit; }
.cp-hint { flex-basis: 100%; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--purple); margin-bottom: 2px; }
.col-prog { flex-wrap: wrap; }
.cline { margin-bottom: 8px; }
.col-group { margin-bottom: 6px; }
.cprog-line { font-size: 14px; margin: 2px 0 7px; }
.cprog-line b { font-family: 'GangwonEduAll', sans-serif; font-size: 19px; color: var(--purple); }
.cp-bar.big { height: 10px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--bg-soft); overflow: hidden; }
.cgrid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; padding-top: 12px; }
.cslot { position: relative; min-width: 0; display: block; }
.cslot .frame { width: 100%; opacity: .55; filter: saturate(.55); transition: opacity .15s, filter .15s; }
.cslot.on .frame { opacity: 1; filter: none; }
.cslot .slot-name { white-space: normal; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box;
  -webkit-line-clamp: 2; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; }
.cmark { position: absolute; top: 6px; right: 6px; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1.5px solid var(--line-warm); background: #FFFEF9; color: var(--tx-3);
  font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 0; }
.cslot.on .cmark { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); color: #fff; }
.cdone { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--purple); margin-left: 4px; }
.report-link { display: block; text-align: center; margin: 14px 16px 0; padding: 11px;
  border: 1.5px dashed var(--line-warm); border-radius: 12px; font-size: 12.5px;
  font-weight: 600; color: var(--tx-2); background: #FFFEF9; }

/* 🎁 교환코드 코너 (꿀팁 상단, 2026-08-17) */
.code-sec{margin-top:6px}
.code-note{font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;color:#8a7b63;background:var(--bg-soft);border:1px solid var(--line-warm);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 12px;margin:2px 2px 12px}
.code-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.code-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;
  background:var(--bg-card);border:1px solid var(--line-warm);border-radius:14px;padding:12px 14px;
  font-family:inherit;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
.code-chip:hover{border-color:var(--purple-line)}
.code-chip.copied{border-color:var(--green);background:#F3FBEE}
.code-val{font-weight:700;font-size:15px;color:var(--purple-deep);letter-spacing:.3px;word-break:break-all}
.code-rw{flex:1;font-size:12.5px;color:#8a7b63}
.code-copy{flex-shrink:0;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--purple);background:var(--purple-pale);
  border-radius:999px;padding:5px 11px;white-space:nowrap}
.code-chip.copied .code-copy{color:#fff;background:var(--green)}
.code-report{display:inline-block;margin:12px 2px 0;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--purple);text-decoration:none}
.code-report:hover{text-decoration:underline}
/* ⏳ 만료 뱃지 + 만료 하루 회색 처리 (2026-08-21) */
.code-exp{flex-shrink:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#c9761f;background:#FCEFDD;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 9px;white-space:nowrap}
.code-exp-gone{color:#9a9a9a;background:#ededed}
.code-expired{opacity:.6}
.code-expired .code-val,.code-expired .wk-val{color:#8a8a8a;text-decoration:line-through}
/* 🌟 이번 주 주말코드 강조 카드 (2026-08-18) */
.wk-card{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#FFF9EC,#F6EEFF);border:1.5px solid var(--purple-line);
  border-radius:18px;padding:14px;margin:2px 2px 16px;box-shadow:0 3px 14px rgba(138,110,190,.13)}
.wk-head{font-family:'GangwonEduAll',sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--purple-deep);
  margin-bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.wk-tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:var(--purple);border-radius:999px;padding:3px 9px}
.wk-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.wk-chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;width:100%;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;
  background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--purple-line);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;
  font-family:inherit;transition:border-color .15s,background .15s}
.wk-chip:hover{border-color:var(--purple)}
.wk-chip.copied{border-color:var(--green);background:#F3FBEE}
.wk-val{font-weight:800;font-size:18px;color:var(--purple-deep);letter-spacing:.4px;word-break:break-all}
.wk-rw{flex:1;font-size:12.5px;color:#8a7b63}
.wk-copy{flex-shrink:0;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;background:var(--purple);
  border-radius:999px;padding:6px 13px;white-space:nowrap}
.wk-chip.copied .wk-copy{background:var(--green)}
.code-hidden{display:none}
.code-more{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:11px;cursor:pointer;font-family:'GangwonEduAll',sans-serif;
  font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--purple);background:var(--purple-pale);border:none;border-radius:12px}
.code-more:hover{background:var(--purple-line)}
#codeMore.code-grid{margin-top:8px}
</style>
<script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-WWMTJFCXH6"></script>
<script>
window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
gtag('js', new Date()); gtag('config', 'G-WWMTJFCXH6');
addEventListener('click', function(e){
  var a = e.target.closest('a,button'); if (!a) return;
  try {
    if (a.closest('.tabbar')) gtag('event', 'tab_click', {tab_name: a.textContent.trim()});
    else if (a.classList.contains('tcard')) gtag('event', 'theme_click', {theme_name: (a.querySelector('.tcard-name')||{}).textContent});
    else if (a.classList.contains('cline') || a.classList.contains('col-prog')) gtag('event', 'collection_click', {collection_name: (a.querySelector('.cp-name')||{}).textContent});
    else if (a.classList.contains('sponsor-cta')) gtag('event', 'sponsor_click');
    else if (a.classList.contains('support-cta')) gtag('event', 'support_click');
    else if ((a.href||'').indexOf('instagram.com') >= 0) gtag('event', 'insta_click');
  } catch (err) {}
}, true);
addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function(){
  var sc = document.querySelector('.sponsor-card');
  if (sc && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(en){
      en.forEach(function(x){ if (x.isIntersecting) { gtag('event', 'sponsor_impression'); io.disconnect(); } });
    }, {threshold: 0.5});
    io.observe(sc);
  }
});
</script>
</head>
<body>
<header>
  <a class="logo-block" href="./">
    <img src="assets/brand/doraji-flower.png" alt="도라지꽃">
    <span class="site-name"><span class="p">코지</span> 꽃수첩</span>
  </a>
  <a class="insta-pill" href="https://instagram.com/dorazy.art" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img class="ig" src="assets/brand/instagram.png" alt="">@dorazy.art</a>
</header>
<div class="divider"><img src="assets/brand/divider.png" alt=""></div>
<section class="weekly">
  <div class="weekly-head"><img src="assets/brand/doraji-icon.png" alt=""><h2>신상 꽃</h2><span class="badge-cnt">7종</span></div>
  <div class="weekly-row"><a class="slot" href="flower/F0371/"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-in"><img src="images/t/F0371.webp" alt="무지갯빛 구름 바퀴"></div></div><div class="slot-name">무지갯빛 구름 바퀴</div></a><a class="slot" href="flower/F0370/"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-in"><img src="images/t/F0370.webp" alt="곰 돛 구름배"></div></div><div class="slot-name">곰 돛 구름배</div></a><a class="slot" href="flower/F0369/"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-in"><img src="images/t/F0369.webp" alt="썬글로우 히페리쿰"></div></div><div class="slot-name">썬글로우 히페리쿰</div></a><a class="slot" href="flower/F0368/"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-in"><img src="images/t/F0368.webp" alt="화려한 서커스"></div></div><div class="slot-name">화려한 서커스</div></a><a class="slot" href="flower/F0352/"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-in"><img src="images/t/F0352.webp" alt="비단 꽃부채"></div></div><div class="slot-name">비단 꽃부채</div></a><a class="slot" href="flower/F0374/"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-in"><img src="images/t/F0374.webp" alt="명월유합"></div></div><div class="slot-name">명월유합</div></a><a class="slot" href="flower/F0373/"><div class="frame"><div class="frame-in"><img src="images/t/F0373.webp" alt="보랏빛 밤의 성단"></div></div><div class="slot-name">보랏빛 밤의 성단</div></a></div>
</section>
<section class="collections">
  <div class="shelf-head"><span class="shelf-icon">🌷</span><h2>어떤 꽃을 모아볼까요?</h2></div>
  <div class="col-sub">취향에 맞는 꽃들을 모아 구경해보세요</div>
  <div class="col-row"><button class="tcard" data-theme="0"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="images/t/F0048.webp" alt="수정빛 나비춤 장미"></span><span class="tcard-name">🌹 장미 컬렉션</span><span class="tcard-count">16송이</span></button><button class="tcard" data-theme="1"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="images/t/F0001.webp" alt="꽃나무 정원"></span><span class="tcard-name">✨ 반짝이는 꽃</span><span class="tcard-count">14송이</span></button><button class="tcard" data-theme="2"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="images/t/F0003.webp" alt="서리구름마"></span><span class="tcard-name">🐰 동물 친구 꽃</span><span class="tcard-count">25송이</span></button><button class="tcard" data-theme="3"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="images/t/F0047.webp" alt="성란화의 언약"></span><span class="tcard-name">🦋 벌과 나비</span><span class="tcard-count">6송이</span></button><button class="tcard" data-theme="4"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="images/t/F0007.webp" alt="구름꿈 고래의 노래"></span><span class="tcard-name">🌊 바다 내음 꽃</span><span class="tcard-count">6송이</span></button><button class="tcard" data-theme="5"><span class="tcard-img"><img src="images/t/F0027.webp" alt="꽃케이크 바구니"></span><span class="tcard-name">🍰 달콤한 디저트 꽃</span><span class="tcard-count">6송이</span></button><div class="tcard tcard-ghost"><span class="tcard-img gh">🌷</span><span class="tcard-name">새 테마</span><span class="tcard-count">준비 중</span></div></div>
</section>
<div class="dex-divider"><h2 id="dexTitle">📖 전체 꽃</h2><button class="help-btn" id="helpBtn" aria-label="카드 표시 안내">?</button><div class="line"></div><button class="theme-reset" id="themeReset" hidden>↺ 전체 보기</button></div>
<div class="legend" id="legend" hidden>
  <div class="lg-title">카드 표시 안내</div>
  <div class="lg-row"><span class="lg-grade">N</span>왼쪽 위 = 등급, 카드 아래 숫자 = 길드전 점수</div>
  <div class="lg-row"><span class="sdot ok"></span>초록 점 = 지금 얻을 수 있어요</div>
  <div class="lg-row"><span class="sdot soon"></span>주황 점 = 출시·복각 예정</div>
